            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Added

- Added Sparkle-powered signed update checks, automatic background updates, and update actions in the menu bar and About settings.
- Added release automation for signed appcasts and versioned Homebrew Casks in the shared public tap.

## Installation

1. Open the DMG and drag `Alcove.app` to `Applications`.
2. Remove the download quarantine attribute:

   ```bash
   sudo xattr -rd com.apple.quarantine /Applications/Alcove.app
   ```

> This arm64 build uses an Apple Development signature and is not notarized.

